                                "sense_id": "82b803d3-81c7-3f9e-aba6-f6d2889a6165",
                                "text": "Therefore know you Gentlemen (to whom from my harte I wish that it may not proue ominous foretoke[n] of misfortune to haue mette with such a miser as I am) that whatsoeuer my sonne (ô God, that trueth binds me to reproch him with the name of my sonne) hath said, is true."
                            }
